# =============================================================================
# COMPILER POINTER TYPES
# =============================================================================
# Lightweight by-path indirection used by compile-pure at every cross-element
# reference site. Each *Pointer extends the m3 type it indirects (so existing
# slot types — `func: Function[1]`, `rawType: Type[0..1]`, etc. — continue to
# type-check). The pointer's resolution key (`path` / `ownerPath`+`name` /
# `profilePath`+`name` / `enumerationPath`+`name`) is captured at mint time
# from a freshly resolved element, then deferred-resolved through the live
# registry at read time, so consumers never see a stale snapshot.
#
# All classes carry the `compiler.pointer` stereotype, which:
#   - lets validateNewFromFI accept the partially populated `^X(...)` form
#   - flags them so FBS schema gen / FBS Java wrapper+writer / protocol gen
#     skip the class (no `XPointerDef`, no `XPointerFlatBufferWrapper`, no
#     `writeXPointer`, no protocol entry)
#
# Java codegen (RdfJavaGenerator) is NOT filtered — pointer classes get a
# Java interface + XImpl just like any other m3 type. This lets compile-pure
# slot `^FunctionPointer(path = ...)` into typed setters like
# `FunctionInvocationImpl._func(Function)` without reflection rejecting the
# value: FunctionPointerImpl implements FunctionPointer which extends
# Function, so the Java type system accepts it.
#
# Pointer instances themselves never appear as standalone elements on the
# wire — at PDB serialization time, the path-extraction helper sees the
# `compiler.pointer` stereotype on the slot value's classifier and emits a
# PointerRef using the pointer's own `path` field rather than walking
# `elementToPath(...)` on a possibly-stale referent.

# --- TempCompilerPointer (abstract base) — every compile-graph pointer has a path ---

:TempCompilerPointer a :Class ;
    :stereotypes :meta_pure_profiles_compiler_pointer, :meta_pure_profiles_typemodifiers_abstract ;
    :name [ :classifierGenericType :GenericType_meta_pure_metamodel_type_primitives_String ; :data "TempCompilerPointer" ] ;
